WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.042
Are your internal audit
files still scattered?

2
00:00:03.842 --> 00:00:07.826
YGATES Denetim Vault brings
risk, planning, engagements,

3
00:00:07.876 --> 00:00:10.995
findings and follow-up together in Obsidian.

4
00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:13.228
Dashboards update as you write.

5
00:00:13.978 --> 00:00:19.334
The workflow is structured in line with
the IIA's 2024 Global Internal Audit

6
00:00:19.384 --> 00:00:23.745
Standards, with a conformance
map for all fifty-two standards.

7
00:00:24.495 --> 00:00:28.211
Thirty-five templates, from the
engagement card to findings,

8
00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.972
