eleven analytic tests.

11
00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:41.414
Everything runs on your computer.

12
00:00:41.464 --> 00:00:43.188
Your data never leaves it.

13
00:00:43.939 --> 00:00:46.418
YGATES Denetim Vault 2.0.

14
00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:49.048
Link in the first comment.
